      reference   : "800-171|3.1.12,800-171r3|03.01.12,800-53|AC-17(1),800-53r5|AC-17(1),CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000067,CN-L3|8.1.4.4(c),CN-L3|8.1.10.6(i),CSF|PR.AC-3,CSF|PR.PT-4,CSF2.0|PR.AA-05,DISA_Benchmark|Cisco_ASA_FW_STIG,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.16,ISO/IEC-27001|A.6.2.2,ITSG-33|AC-17(1),NESA|T5.4.4,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,Rule-ID|SV-239854r665848_rule,STIG-ID|CASA-FW-000030,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.6,Vuln-ID|V-239854"
